    /* Contact on the parts that are not a button or a field [G1, G4]: three ticks of 60 ms,
       never the register's smooth curve. A group of the side navigation unfolds and folds, its
       chevron turns, on the same three ticks, the fold being the unfold's jump-start mirror; the
       panel's own slide reads the token (js/sidenav.js turns it round for the close). */
