    /* ── Q2, Q3 · opening: the gold inlay draws itself, the lacquer comes up.
       A dialog, a menu, a popover, a tooltip, a toast, a drawer and a tour card
       come in as ONE keyframe set on the settle: the inlay drawn from the
       middle of its top edge round both ways until it meets at the bottom
       (320 ms; the tooltip's starts at its lozenge), then the lacquer, the
       wallpaper and the words come up behind it (160 ms). Each close is that
       set played backwards, in the same time, by js/motion.js
       (`--kp-open: reverse-close`): the lacquer sinks, the inlay undraws to
