       and folds away rib by rib, taking the satin with it; a part arrives as
       that played backwards (js/motion.js turns it round, the hidden part
       showing again as the fan folds off it). The fan is the part's own
       ::before (the satin field, the guard sticks, the pivot) and ::after (the
