       ring; the days and the axis in spaced capitals; the line for now is gold with a lozenge at its head. A running
       run is drawn between two gold hairlines with the glint and its afterglow running between them. */
    [data-theme='deco'] .kp-week {
        --kp-week-pill-radius: 0;
        --kp-week-now: var(--primary);
    }
    [data-theme='deco'] .kp-gantt {
        --kp-gantt-bar-radius: 0;
        --kp-gantt-now: var(--primary);
