    /* Pointing, focus and press on a control [hover, focus, press, composites].
       Pointing sets two amber witness lines at the control's ends, overhanging its
       top and running on below its foot to a ruler with a pointer on each end:
       the control is read on a scale (--kp-bp-hv the lines, --kp-bp-sv the
       scale). Focus keeps DI2's two-channel ring and the lines. A press takes
       the dimension: the lines run on further, the scale gives way to a dimension
       with a slash at each end, drawn in two units below the part, outside it
       (--kp-bp-dv); the part's own ground never changes. The size is lettered on it
       (see the dimension's own rule below). */
    [data-theme='blueprint'] :is(.kp-button, .kp-icon-button) {
        position: relative;
        --kp-bp-n1: hsl(from var(--accent) h s l / var(--kp-bp-hv));
        --kp-bp-n2: hsl(from var(--accent) h s l / calc(var(--kp-bp-sv) * var(--kp-bp-hv)));
