    /* ── The palette's trigger in the bar [scope-48, scope-80] ─────────── */

    /* In the voice of this register's own nav links (Kenny, 2026-09-14,
       search-voice "Per thema"): the body face at a size above the small
       text, in the full ink, on a half radius; under the pointer the primary
       ink this register gives its quiet language link, and the two-pixel
       weight a pointed-at link's underline takes, drawn as a rule because a
       button has no underline to thicken. The link's typeface, case,
       spacing, shape and pointer answer are restated here, because the
       trigger is a button beside the list rather than a link in it. The
       underline a plain link carries is not: it says "this is a link", and
       the trigger is not one. */
    [data-theme='formal'] .kp-nav__search .kp-nav__search-trigger {
