       entries one by one; a drawer's head, body and foot; a tour card's
       title, text and foot); a 2 px navy pen runs ahead of the words and is
       lifted, from the start, 160 ms after it has reached the margin (the
       finished pose is bare). A close is the same motion played backwards,
       bottom first, end to start; what arrives is the leave turned around
